        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4. 六六六和 DDT 的检出限系指其四种异物体检出限之和。",
        "bbox": [
            179,
            558,
            571,
            572
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5 混合区的规定",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            119,
            584,
            258,
            599
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "污水集中排放形成的混合区，不得影响邻近功能区的水质和鱼类回游通道。",
        "bbox": [
            152,
            612,
            735,
            628
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "GB 3097—1997",
        "bbox": [
            463,
            79,
            588,
            94
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "19",
        "bbox": [
            881,
            914,
            903,
            926
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "无机氮的计算",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            482,
            125,
            597,
            140
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "无机氮是硝酸盐氮、亚硝酸盐氮和氨氮的总和，无机氮也称“活性氮”，或简称“三氮”。",
        "bbox": [
            135,
            152,
            833,
            168
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "在现行监测中，水样中的硝酸盐、亚硝酸盐和氮的浓度是以 $\\mu mol/L$ 表示总和。而本标准规定无机氮是以氮（N）计，单位采用 mg/L，因此，按下式计算无机氮：",
        "bbox": [
            135,
            171,
            941,
            205
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nc (\\mathrm{N}) = 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\left[ c \\left(\\mathrm{NO} _ {3} - \\mathrm{N}\\right) + c \\left(\\mathrm{NO} _ {2} - \\mathrm{N}\\right) + c \\left(\\mathrm{NH} _ {3}\\right) - \\mathrm{N}) \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            275,
            208,
            802,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式中： $c(N)$ ——无机氮浓度，以 N 计，mg/L；",
        "bbox": [
            135,
            228,
            505,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$c(\\mathrm{NO}_{3}-\\mathrm{N})$ ——用监测方法测出的水样中硝酸盐的浓度， $\\mu mol/L$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            247,
            656,
            262
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$c(\\mathrm{NO}_{2}-\\mathrm{N})$ ——用监测方法测出的水样中亚硝酸盐的浓度， $\\mu mol/L$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            266,
            673,
            281
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$c(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}-\\mathrm{N})$ ——用监测方法测出的水样中氨的浓度， $\\mu mol/L$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            285,
            621,
            300
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "附录 A（标准的附录）",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            90,
            308,
            104
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "20",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            924,
            178,
            936
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "非离子氨换算方法",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            457,
            130,
            608,
            146
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "按靛酚蓝法，次溴酸钠氧化法（GB 12763.4—91）测定得到的氨浓度（ $\\mathrm{NH}_3 - \\mathrm{N}$ ）看作是非离子氨与离子氨浓度的总和，非离子氨在氨的水溶液中的比例与水温、 $\\mathsf{pH}$ 值以及盐度有关。可按下述公式换算出",
        "bbox": [
            127,
            167,
            935,
            202
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "非离子氨的浓度：",
        "bbox": [
            129,
            204,
            269,
            220
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nc \\left(\\mathrm{NH} _ {3}\\right) = 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 5} c \\left(\\mathrm{NH} _ {3} - \\mathrm{N}\\right) \\cdot f\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            394,
            204,
            671,
            220
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf = 1 0 0 / \\left(1 0 ^ {\\mathrm{p} K _ {\\mathrm{a}} ^ {S \\cdot T} - \\mathrm{pH}} + 1\\right)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            453,
            223,
            648,
            241
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{p} K _ {\\mathrm{a}} ^ {S \\cdot T} = 9. 2 4 5 + 0. 0 0 2 9 4 9 \\mathrm{S} + 0. 0 3 2 4 (2 9 8 - \\mathrm{T})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            452,
            244,
            835,
            262
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式中：f——氨的水溶液中非离子氨的摩尔百分比；",
        "bbox": [
            127,
            264,
            565,
            280
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$c(\\mathrm{NH}_{3})$ ——现场温度、pH、盐度下，水样中非离子氨的浓度（以N计），mg/L；",
        "bbox": [
            166,
            282,
            804,
            298
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$c(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}-\\mathrm{N})$ ——用监测方法测得的水样中氨的浓度， $\\mu mol/L$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            136,
            302,
            623,
            317
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "T——海水温度，K；",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            321,
            382,
            336
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "S——海水盐度；",
        "bbox": [
            216,
            340,
            352,
            354
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "pH——海水的 pH;",
        "bbox": [
            204,
            358,
            360,
            373
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$pK_{a}^{S\\cdot T}$ ——温度为 $T(T=273+t)$ ，盐度为 S 的海水中的 $NH_{4}^{+}$ 的解离平衡常数 $K_{a}^{S\\cdot T}$ 的负对数。",
        "bbox": [
            178,
            377,
            917,
            394
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "附加说明：",
        "bbox": [
            164,
            462,
            250,
            477
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准由国家海洋局第三海洋研究所和青岛海洋大学负责起草。",
        "bbox": [
            162,
            489,
            661,
            505
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准主要起草人：黄自强、张克、许昆灿、隋永年、孙淑媛、陆贤昆、林庆礼。",
